  <!--EN: ambrandy must-->
  <VBE_AmbrandyMust.label>仙馐酒原浆</VBE_AmbrandyMust.label>
  <!--EN: A somewhat ornate countertop stocked to the brim with different vessels and devices for making a variety of drinks. An ice box, a series of taps, hoses, and carbonators means anybody tending it can brew much quicker than at a rudimentary brewery.-->
