  <!--EN: A potent liquor distilled from fermented grain. The flavors of the aging barrel tend to permeate this spirit more than others. A woody, almost smokey flavor is pronounced throughout. Simple whiskeys are stereotypically associated with rough manual laborers and hard workers, a common sight in steamworlds across the galaxy.-->
